## Where the colour comes from

The Rudolph Spring rises beneath the Nové Lázně spa house. Its high iron content gives it the characteristic reddish-brown hue — a signature of this source.

## Who drinks it

The Rudolph Spring is prescribed for iron deficiency, post-operative recovery, and restorative programmes. Dosage is always set by the spa physician.
